  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "The shaman “Manshin Kim Seo-Ryeong” of Yeongwoldang. The client “Noh Seung-Rae” who was born into a shaman family and lives rejecting the spirit rope, receives a request from Seo-Ryeong to visit her daughter who is blind. However, due to Seung-Rae’s attitude of not believing in shamanism and ignoring it, Seo-Ryeong does not accept the request and returns. However, from that day on, Seung-Rae’s past is reflected in Seo-Ryeong’s dreams. In the end, Seo-Ryeong follows Seung-Rae’s family…\n\nThe daughter of this family has an unusual aura?!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
